<b>Options Sets</b></p><a name=\"opt-item.sex\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for sex </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">http://hl7.org/fhir/administrative-gender#male (\"Male\")</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">http://hl7.org/fhir/administrative-gender#female (\"Female\")</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.reason-for-referral\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for reason-for-referral </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Diagnosis</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Treatment</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Adverse reaction to drugs</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Other</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.referral-source\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for referral-source </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Community TB Worker (CTW)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Community Pharmacist (CP)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Patent Medicine Vendor (PMV)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Community Volunteer (CV)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Laboratory</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Other</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.diagnosis-outcome\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for diagnosis-outcome </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">TB confirmed</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">TB not confirmed</li></ul></div>"
